# Build context for the all-in-one image (all-in-one/Dockerfile) is the repo
# root. Keep local-only, licensed, and regenerated material out of it. The
# split backend/ and frontend/ image builds use their own .dockerignore.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
backend/server/data
backend/**/coverage.out
**/.local.env
**/.env.local
.DS_Store
.idea
docs
k8s
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
